Description: Provides SAS-inspired character manipulation functions
    for R users who regularly work with both SAS and R. Includes
    functions for character compression, word extraction, substring
    operations, concatenation, searching, and replacement. Supports
    vectorized operations and integration with data manipulation
    workflows.
